      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AUSSIE TAN (1) was overdue for a win and racing consistently, finishing in the minors three on end, before finding trouble last time and finishing fourth in a Grade 6 at this track (22.36). Looks the one to beat on best. HE'S SAVVY (8) ran well two back when hitting the frame then out of the placings at Mandurah latest but returns to a distance where he has performed well. Can improve sharply here. LARA MAGIC (2) jumped well and was in the mix early before fading out of it late when 5th over 381m at this track in Grade 6 company. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Cannot be underestimated. WYVERN (7) was in the money last start and poses a threat again.",
